🌸 AI-Based PCOS Prediction & Women Health Management System

An intelligent healthcare web application built using Django + Machine Learning for predicting PCOS risk, tracking menstrual cycles, managing appointments, and providing personalized health recommendations.

---
🚀 Project Overview

This system helps women monitor reproductive health by combining:

- 🧠 AI-powered PCOS Prediction
- 📅 Menstrual Cycle Tracking
- 👩‍⚕️ Doctor Appointment Booking
- 📊 Health Analysis Dashboard
- 📄 Automated PDF Medical Reports
- 🥗 Diet & Home Remedy Suggestions

It provides early health insights and supports preventive care through predictive analytics.

---

 🛠 Tech Stack

Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- Bootstrap
- JavaScript

Backend
- Django (Python)

Database
- SQLite

Machine Learning
- Scikit-learn
- Joblib
- NumPy

PDF Report Generation
- ReportLab

---

 🧠 Machine Learning Features

 PCOS Prediction Model
Predicts PCOS risk using:

- Age
- Cycle Length
- BMI
- Acne Symptoms
- Hair Fall
- Weight Gain

Algorithms Used
- Random Forest Classifier
- Probability-based Risk Prediction

