 ✨ Core Features

 👩 User Module
- Secure Registration & Login
- Profile Management
- Period Tracking
- Cycle History Analysis
- Next Period Prediction
- PCOS Risk Prediction
- Download Medical Report PDF
- Book Doctor Appointment
- View Doctor Advice

---

 👨‍⚕️ Doctor Module
- Doctor Registration
- Appointment Management
- View Patient Reports
- Provide Diet Plans
- Give Medical Advice
- Treatment Notes

---

 🛡 Admin Module
- Manage Doctors
- Manage Users
- Approve / Reject Appointments
- Add Diet & Remedies
- Monitor System Activities

---

 📊 Prediction Output

The system predicts:

- PCOS Detection Status
- Risk Probability (%)
- Personalized Health Advice
- Next Cycle Prediction
- Hormonal Delay Analysis

---

 📄 Smart Report Generation

Generate downloadable PCOS Diagnostic Reports including:

- Patient Details
- Risk Analysis
- Probability Score
- Doctor Recommendation
- Generated PDF Summary

---

 🎯 Problem Solved

Women often struggle with:

- Irregular cycle monitoring
- Early PCOS detection
- Health record management
- Finding proper medical guidance

This system offers AI-assisted early diagnosis and medical support.

